direction_162 = location "Hellfire" about "Hell Fire" found "Ronark Land" at 0 0 in zone 71
direction_164 = location "Havoc" found "Ronark Land" at 0 0 in zone 71

On offer
    Say "The word is that both Hell Fire and Havoc are in the outskirts of Ronark Land. There is no great danger now as they are quite far from here, but we might have a huge disaster in our hands if even just one of them was to make a move..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "If you could take care of them both, I will give you a weapon made just for you. So what do you think?"

On in_progress
    Say "Getting rid of their followers first could be a way. I heard that some of followers cast HP restoring spells."

On ready
    Say "They were quite strong, weren't they, Master? Good job!"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Did you get rid of them? (Perhaps they weren't that strong after all... I got scared for nothing...)\nHm~ well done. So, what equipment would you like?"
